cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bansat in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bansat (بنسټ): A blueprint-first framework for building software"
abstract: >-
  Bansat (Pashto for "foundation") is a blueprint-first framework and Claude Agent Skill
  for planning new software projects and auditing existing ones before code is written.
  It covers product requirements, architecture, security, UK/EU GDPR, PECR and Nigeria
  NDPA compliance, UI states, delivery and launch readiness.
